[2025-09-23 21:00:51,615][heimdall.core][INFO] - Cleaned output : entities:
  - name: Xoa
    type: method
    description: Represents the Object-Attribute co-occurrence counts. For each region in VisualGenome, it is incremented by 1 for each word pair (i, j) where (i, j) belongs to the Cartesian product of object synsets (So) and attribute synsets (Sa).
  - name: Xaa
    type: method
    description: Represents the Attribute-Attribute co-occurrence counts. For each region in VisualGenome, it is incremented by 1 for each word pair (i, j) where (i, j) belongs to the Cartesian product of two attribute synsets (Sa1, Sa2).
  - name: Xc
    type: method
    description: Represents the Concept-Concept co-occurrence counts. For each image in VisualGenome, it is incremented by 1 for each word pair (i, j) where (i, j) belongs to the Cartesian product of two concept synsets (Sc1, Sc2), where C is the union of all object synsets annotated in an image.
  - name: Xoh
    type: method
    description: Represents the Object-Hypernym co-occurrence counts. For each image in ImageNet, it is incremented by 1 for each word pair (i, j) where (i, j) belongs to the Cartesian product of two synsets (Sh1, Sh2), where H is a set of object synsets annotated for an image in ImageNet and its ancestors in WordNet.

